  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the lentils and soak them in water for 30 minutes.",
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and coriander seeds and let them sizzle for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the tamarind paste, salt, and lentils, and stir well.",
    "Add the water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the stew simmer for 40 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
